            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "If-None-Match",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "datasource",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "The server name you would like data from"
              },
              {
                "name": "max_war_id",
                "value": "28332",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Only return wars with ID smaller than this"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Return a list of wars\n\n---\nAlternate route: `/dev/wars/`\n\nAlternate route: `/legacy/wars/`\n\nAlternate route: `/v1/wars/`\n\n---\nThis route is cached for up to 3600 seconds"
